# Raw per-run series under raw/<device>/... ARE committed (they back every
# RESULTS.md table). run.sh sanitizes each runN.log at capture time to ONLY
# the perf/marker lines stats.py parses (frust-perf / flutter-perf /
# bench-scenario-*) — full-device logcat never persists. Before committing a
# new batch, verify the whitelist held:
#   grep -rlvE 'frust-perf|flutter-perf|bench-scenario|^$' raw/  (expect no output)
# Transient capture scratch (pre-sanitize) — never committed:
*.unfiltered
*.console.txt
*.container.txt
.pss_before.txt
.pss_after.txt
